msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Original Diff"
msgstr "Orginaalverscheel"

#: msgiddiffview.cpp:60
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, if original text is changed, its translation becomes "
"<emphasis>fuzzy</emphasis> (i.e. looses approval status). This window shows "
"the difference between new original string and the old one, so that you can "
"easily see which changes should be applied to translation."
msgstr ""
"Mennigmaal, wenn de Orginaaltext ännert wöör, warrt de Översetten "
"<emphasis>twiefelhaftig</emphasis>. Dit Finster wiest den Verscheel twischen "
"nieg Orginaal- un de ole Tekenkeed, so dat Een de Ännern ankieken kann, de "
"villicht na de Översetten överdregen warrn schullen."

